                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                        "entry_id": "a97cd91a-dd21-3506-9441-d86b810dbcf0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "waarover geen twijfel kan bestaan"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7de72d5b-c5b9-4e47-8a0e-632adf3b29aa",
                                "sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                                "text": "Hij is daarin een onmiskenbaar talent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ca737db-1737-4299-bbcd-2599d17a9f4a",
                                "sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                                "text": "Zij grossierde niet bepaald in vormen. Met haar benige, tanige en uitgemergelde gestalte was zij meer iemand van duidelijke en consequente lijnen. Maar zij was in haar etherische hardheid onmiskenbaar fascinerend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "102c25b3-ca3c-4332-98b6-962a876d7abd",
                                "sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                                "text": "Het was onmiskenbaar een goede tijd voor de hele vrijemarktwereld wanneer zelfs een baviaan, of een chimpansee dus, een vermogen kon vergaren door met aandelen te handelen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bad27cbb-2e9e-472a-b530-1c5f0d06b8f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "a97cd91a-dd21-3506-9441-d86b810dbcf0",
                        "source_sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                        "source_sense_description": "waarover geen twijfel kan bestaan",
                        "target_lang_word": "unleugbar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unleugbar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd7cad28-c005-315d-8449-670d04a99ad8",
                                        "entry_id": "c4af6eea-c860-36f3-9293-69e12b080eb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sich nicht bestreiten/widerlegen lassend, unbestreitbar"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d8d697b-2ae4-4be9-a3af-a852a7983511",
                                                "sense_id": "bd7cad28-c005-315d-8449-670d04a99ad8",
                                                "text": "Die Morde in Duisburg waren ein unleugbares Zeichen dafür, wie aktiv die Mafia in Deutschland ist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bac5a098-81f8-4422-8f85-ae39029889d7",
                                                "sense_id": "bd7cad28-c005-315d-8449-670d04a99ad8",
                                                "text": "In ihrer Unmittelbarkeit und Ungeschminktheit sind sie [die Aussagen einfacher Soldaten der Wehrmacht in Sönke Neitzels Buch „Abgehört“] geeignet, jene Zeitgenossen zu verstören, die teilweise noch immer an die Legende von der »sauber« gebliebenen Wehrmacht glauben und unleugbare Verbrechen als Randphänomene abtun."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98562c30-0d0a-4a71-9b72-3e97fcb6467f",
                        "source_entry_id": "a97cd91a-dd21-3506-9441-d86b810dbcf0",
                        "source_sense_id": "3cc7d355-237b-351e-ab18-bf5f31de0277",
                        "source_sense_description": "waarover geen twijfel kan bestaan",
                        "target_lang_word": "unmistakable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unmistakable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c68a5432-a8ae-3f7e-a5c2-ecb9e0d21b60",
                                        "entry_id": "155363c4-a599-3968-801a-9ca6c7d8a1bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unique, such that it cannot be mistaken for something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b692289-9a79-48bf-a990-f0a591fc3295",
                                                "sense_id": "c68a5432-a8ae-3f7e-a5c2-ecb9e0d21b60",
                                                "text": "Now, I still think that for this box of matches to have escaped the wear of time for immemorial years was a strange, and for me, a most fortunate thing. Yet oddly enough I found here a far more unlikely substance, and that was camphor. I found it in a sealed jar, that, by chance, I supposed had been really hermetically sealed. I fancied at first the stuff was paraffin wax, and smashed the jar accordingly. But the odor of camphor was unmistakable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbccba69-5f82-49b3-8d01-7fd2655e3902",
                                                "sense_id": "c68a5432-a8ae-3f7e-a5c2-ecb9e0d21b60",
                                                "text": "Whenever the locomotive was working hard there was unmistakable evidence of its higher power than its predecessors in the brilliant and explosive arcing between conductor shoes and the third rail; this was particularly vivid in Quarry Tunnel in the down direction, where the display equalled anything we have seen on the frostiest of nights in an electrified third-rail area."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99765043-c4d9-4eb4-901e-1ca38c5e52cc",
                                                "sense_id": "c68a5432-a8ae-3f7e-a5c2-ecb9e0d21b60",
                                                "text": "And while that number is expected to shift back slightly into positive territory over this decade, fewer children today establishes an unmistakable implication for tomorrow: fewer adults available as consumers, workers and taxpayers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
